1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,064
Saal 1917. Berlin.

2
00:00:02,084 --> 00:00:06,755
Duniya ka sab se bada dimagh — Albert Einstein — apni hi equations ko ghoor raha hai.

3
00:00:07,150 --> 00:00:10,755
Aur equations usay ek aisi baat bata rahi hain jo usay bilkul pasand nahi:

4
00:00:11,240 --> 00:00:12,705
Kainat ruki hui NAHI hai.

5
00:00:13,365 --> 00:00:14,580
To Einstein ne kya kiya?

6
00:00:14,599 --> 00:00:19,804
Apni hi equation mein ek extra number zabardasti daal diya — taake kainat ruki hui nazar aaye.

7
00:00:20,344 --> 00:00:23,849
Baad mein usne isay apni zindagi ki "sab se badi ghalti" kaha.

8
00:00:24,163 --> 00:00:25,792
Lekin asal kahani yeh nahi.

9
00:00:26,147 --> 00:00:33,412
Asal kahani yeh hai ke Einstein se 1300 saal pehle — Arab ke registan mein — ek kitab mein do lafz maujood the.

10
00:00:33,561 --> 00:00:38,051
Aur un do lafzon ka seedha ma'ni wohi hai jo Einstein ki equations keh rahi thin...

11
00:00:38,164 --> 00:00:41,268
aur jise maan'ne se khud Einstein ne inkaar kar diya.

12
00:00:41,429 --> 00:00:45,013
Aaj: woh teen ayaat jo kainat ki poori kahani suna deti hain.

13
00:00:45,783 --> 00:00:48,954
Woh kabootar jinhone do scientists ko Nobel Prize dilwa diya.

14
00:00:49,384 --> 00:00:55,829
Aur aakhir mein Quran ka woh sawal — sirf do ayaton ka — jise sun kar Quraysh ke ek sardar ka beta keh utha:

15
00:00:56,043 --> 00:00:58,234
"Qareeb tha ke mera dil ud jaye."

16
00:00:58,598 --> 00:01:00,403
Chaliye — waqt ko ulta chalate hain.

17
00:01:03,463 --> 00:01:06,409
Pehle yeh samjhiye ke Einstein itna pareshan kyun tha.

18
00:01:06,674 --> 00:01:11,959
Aristotle ke zamane se — do hazaar saal se zyada — science aur falsafe ki ghalib raaye ek hi thi:

19
00:01:12,213 --> 00:01:13,859
kainat hamesha se hai.

20
00:01:14,066 --> 00:01:16,472
Na iski koi shuruaat, na yeh badalti hai.

21
00:01:16,739 --> 00:01:20,785
Sitare apni jagah latke hue hain — jaise deewar par tangi hui tasveer.

22
00:01:21,069 --> 00:01:23,285
Aur sochiye: agar kainat hamesha se hai...

23
00:01:23,305 --> 00:01:25,255
to "banane wale" ka sawal hi khatam.

24
00:01:25,412 --> 00:01:28,838
Jo cheez kabhi shuru hi nahi hui — usay shuru kisne kiya?

25
00:01:29,117 --> 00:01:33,222
Mashhoor falsafi Bertrand Russell ne BBC radio par yehi kaha tha:

26
00:01:33,518 --> 00:01:35,523
"Kainat bas hai — aur baat khatam."

27
00:01:36,212 --> 00:01:38,523
Yeh tha inkaar ka sab se mazboot qila.

28
00:01:38,742 --> 00:01:42,028
Phir Einstein ki apni theory — General Relativity — aati hai.

29
00:01:42,236 --> 00:01:46,261
Aur uski maths kehti hai: yeh tasveer deewar par tik hi nahi sakti.

30
00:01:46,358 --> 00:01:49,243
Kainat ya to phailegi — ya sikudegi.

31
00:01:49,453 --> 00:01:50,579
Ruk nahi sakti.

32
00:01:50,963 --> 00:01:52,829
Jaise aap gend hawa mein uchhalein.

33
00:01:53,509 --> 00:01:55,719
Woh ya upar ja rahi hogi — ya neeche aa rahi hogi.

34
00:01:56,248 --> 00:01:58,059
Hawa mein ruki hui gend? Namumkin.

35
00:01:58,364 --> 00:02:00,529
Einstein ko apni hi maths par yaqeen nahi aaya.

36
00:02:01,058 --> 00:02:04,904
Usne woh extra number jod diya — taake gend hawa mein ruki rahe.

37
00:02:05,118 --> 00:02:09,224
Aur phir kahani mein ek aisa kirdaar aata hai jiski kisi ko tawaqqo nahi thi.

38
00:02:09,342 --> 00:02:12,766
Ek padri — jo physicist bhi tha. Georges Lemaître.

39
00:02:13,384 --> 00:02:16,844
1927 mein Lemaître ne Einstein ki hi equations se dikhaya:

40
00:02:16,865 --> 00:02:18,675
kainat phail rahi hai.

41
00:02:19,123 --> 00:02:21,649
Aur agar aaj phail rahi hai... to kal chhoti thi.

42
00:02:21,753 --> 00:02:23,278
Parson aur chhoti.

43
00:02:23,548 --> 00:02:28,693
Film ko ulta chalate jaiye — to ek lamha aisa aayega jab sab kuch ek nuqte mein simta hua tha.

44
00:02:28,963 --> 00:02:31,717
Einstein ka jawab? Lemaître ke apne bayan ke mutabiq:

45
00:02:31,737 --> 00:02:35,147
"Tumhara hisaab durust hai — lekin tumhari physics bardasht se bahar hai."

46
00:02:35,513 --> 00:02:37,268
Sirf do saal baad. 1929.

47
00:02:37,288 --> 00:02:43,618
California ki ek pahadi par Edwin Hubble us waqt ki sab se badi telescope se door ki galaxies dekhta hai.

48
00:02:43,671 --> 00:02:46,225
Door ki galaxies hum se door bhaag rahi hain.

49
00:02:46,246 --> 00:02:48,557
Aur jo jitni door hai — utni hi tez.

50
00:02:49,006 --> 00:02:52,611
Kainat phail rahi thi. Einstein ghalat tha. Padri sahi tha.

51
00:02:52,861 --> 00:02:53,375
Aur ab...

52
00:02:53,395 --> 00:02:57,026
woh ayat suniye jo us waqt Quran mein terah sau saal pehle nazil ho chuki thi.

53
00:02:57,306 --> 00:02:59,652
Surah Adh-Dhariyat ki ayat number saintalees:

54
00:03:00,433 --> 00:03:05,544
"Aur aasman ko Hum ne quwwat se banaya — aur yaqeenan Hum wus'at dene wale hain."

55
00:03:05,893 --> 00:03:07,478
Is aakhri lafz par rukiye.

56
00:03:07,663 --> 00:03:08,808
"La-musi'un."

57
00:03:08,927 --> 00:03:11,073
Arabi mein kaam batane ke do tareeqe hain.

58
00:03:11,492 --> 00:03:14,453
Ek: "Ahmad ne gaadi chalayi." Kaam hua — khatam.

59
00:03:14,656 --> 00:03:17,781
Doosra: "Ahmad driver hai." Yeh guzra hua kaam nahi.

60
00:03:18,348 --> 00:03:20,299
Yeh uski pehchaan hai. Jaari sifat.

61
00:03:20,723 --> 00:03:23,829
Quran ne yahan doosra tareeqa chuna. "Hum ne phailaya" nahi.

62
00:03:24,278 --> 00:03:25,743
"Hum phailane wale HAIN."

63
00:03:26,087 --> 00:03:29,332
Ab insaaf ki baat — kyunke is channel par hum aap se sirf sach kahenge.

64
00:03:29,598 --> 00:03:32,263
Purane mufassireen ne is lafz ke do ma'ni likhe hain.

65
00:03:32,522 --> 00:03:32,777
Ek:

66
00:03:32,798 --> 00:03:40,927
"Hum badi qudrat wale hain." Doosra — jo Imam Ibn Kathir ne likha — "Hum ne isay wasee' kar diya." Aur Maulana Maududi ne dono ma'ni likh kar kaha:

67
00:03:40,948 --> 00:03:44,578
doosre ma'ni ke mutabiq yeh kainat musalsal phail rahi hai.

68
00:03:44,927 --> 00:03:48,042
To daawa yeh nahi ke saatwin sadi ke Arab "Big Bang" jaante the.

69
00:03:48,062 --> 00:03:50,193
Zahir hai nahi jaante the. Sawal yeh hai:

70
00:03:50,402 --> 00:03:58,503
jis zamane mein poori duniya aasman ko ek thehri hui chhat samajhti thi — us zamane mein aasman ke liye yeh lafz kisne chuna?

71
00:03:58,867 --> 00:04:01,673
Aur 1998 mein ek aur baat pata chali:

72
00:04:02,173 --> 00:04:04,263
yeh phailao ruk nahi raha. Tez ho raha hai.

73
00:04:04,562 --> 00:04:06,228
Lekin rukiye. Yeh to sirf "phailao" hai.

74
00:04:06,337 --> 00:04:09,908
Asli jhatka tab lagta hai... jab aap film ko poora ulta chalate hain.

75
00:04:10,858 --> 00:04:13,192
Peeche chaliye. Ek arab saal... das arab saal...

76
00:04:13,212 --> 00:04:16,942
thirteen point eight billion years peeche. Wahan kya hai?

77
00:04:17,382 --> 00:04:20,258
Na sitare. Na galaxies. Na zameen. Na aasman.

78
00:04:20,278 --> 00:04:25,957
Saara maada, saari energy — ek intehai garam, intehai ghani haalat mein.

79
00:04:26,533 --> 00:04:27,622
Yakja. Juda hua.

80
00:04:28,173 --> 00:04:30,617
Ab Surah Al-Anbiya ki ayat number tees:

81
00:04:30,827 --> 00:04:37,802
"Kya inkaar karne walon ne nahi dekha ke aasman aur zameen aapas mein jude hue the — phir Hum ne unhein juda juda kar diya?"

82
00:04:38,141 --> 00:04:39,965
Do lafz. "Ratq." Aur "Fatq."

83
00:04:40,276 --> 00:04:44,000
"Ratq" — Arabi mein us cheez ko kehte hain jo si di gayi ho. Band.

84
00:04:44,276 --> 00:04:44,800
Judi hui.

85
00:04:44,911 --> 00:04:48,735
Beech mein koi darz nahi. "Fatq" — us silai ko udhed dena.

86
00:04:48,755 --> 00:04:50,365
Cheer kar alag kar dena.

87
00:04:50,494 --> 00:04:51,809
To ayat keh rahi hai:

88
00:04:51,829 --> 00:04:56,338
aasman aur zameen — yaani yeh poori kainat — ek sili hui, yakja cheez thi.

89
00:04:56,358 --> 00:04:57,968
Phir Hum ne usay udhed diya.

90
00:04:58,298 --> 00:05:00,114
Aur yeh koi nayi "modern" tafsir nahi.

91
00:05:00,134 --> 00:05:04,334
Tabi'een ke imam — Hasan Basri aur Qatadah — ne 1300 saal pehle yehi kaha:

92
00:05:04,353 --> 00:05:07,803
"Dono jude hue the — phir Allah ne unhein juda kar diya."

93
00:05:08,144 --> 00:05:09,679
Ab ayat ka pehla lafz dekhiye:

94
00:05:09,699 --> 00:05:11,894
"Awalam yara" — "kya unhone DEKHA nahi?"

95
00:05:11,913 --> 00:05:14,443
Saatwin sadi mein kaun dekh sakta tha? Koi nahi.

96
00:05:14,619 --> 00:05:16,723
Lekin 1964 mein...

97
00:05:16,988 --> 00:05:18,726
insaan ne waqai dekh liya.

98
00:05:18,992 --> 00:05:21,116
Aur yahan kahani mein kabootar aate hain.

99
00:05:22,072 --> 00:05:24,487
1964. America. New Jersey.

100
00:05:24,507 --> 00:05:31,877
Do radio astronomers — Arno Penzias aur Robert Wilson — ek bade, seeng jaise antenna par kaam kar rahe hain.

101
00:05:31,896 --> 00:05:33,937
Aur antenna mein ek ajeeb shor hai.

102
00:05:33,956 --> 00:05:37,691
Antenna jis taraf bhi ghumao — shor wahi.

103
00:05:37,882 --> 00:05:38,971
Din mein — wahi.

104
00:05:39,322 --> 00:05:39,990
Raat mein — wahi.

105
00:05:40,262 --> 00:05:41,291
Garmi, sardi — wahi.

106
00:05:41,776 --> 00:05:43,191
Unhone socha: antenna kharab hai.

107
00:05:43,211 --> 00:05:46,431
Andar jhaank kar dekha — to kabootaron ne ghonsla bana rakha tha.

108
00:05:46,451 --> 00:05:49,009
Aur antenna... un ki beet se bhara pada tha.

109
00:05:49,274 --> 00:05:52,410
Penzias ne badi sharafat se isay ek science-wala naam diya:

110
00:05:52,430 --> 00:05:55,479
"white dielectric material." Safed maada.

111
00:05:55,870 --> 00:05:59,234
Do PhD scientists ne apne haathon se woh antenna saaf kiya.

112
00:05:59,485 --> 00:06:00,929
Kabootar hata diye gaye.

113
00:06:01,074 --> 00:06:01,579
Shor...

114
00:06:01,769 --> 00:06:02,019
wahin ka wahin.

115
00:06:02,819 --> 00:06:06,424
Kyunke woh shor antenna ka nahi tha. Woh shor kainat ka tha.

116
00:06:06,865 --> 00:06:16,279
Woh us pehle lamhe ki bachi hui roshni thi — jo 13.8 arab saal se safar kar rahi hai, aur aaj bhi aasman ke har kone se aa rahi hai.

117
00:06:16,644 --> 00:06:22,549
Aapko yaad hai — purane antenna wale TV par jab channel nahi lagta tha to screen par "jhilmil" aati thi?

118
00:06:22,889 --> 00:06:24,834
Us jhilmil ka ek chhota sa hissa...

119
00:06:25,004 --> 00:06:25,854
yehi roshni thi.

120
00:06:26,375 --> 00:06:30,050
Aap apne drawing room mein baith kar kainat ki paidaish ki goonj dekh rahe the.

121
00:06:30,069 --> 00:06:31,560
Aur aapko pata bhi nahi tha.

122
00:06:32,035 --> 00:06:34,899
1978 mein dono ko Nobel Prize mila.

123
00:06:35,345 --> 00:06:36,709
"Kya unhone nahi dekha?"

124
00:06:37,035 --> 00:06:37,979
Dekh liya.

125
00:06:39,019 --> 00:06:41,424
Ek aur ayat. Aur yahan chemistry aati hai.

126
00:06:41,605 --> 00:06:42,439
jis ka tarjuma hai:

127
00:06:42,459 --> 00:06:47,199
"Phir Woh aasman ki taraf mutawajjeh hua — aur woh us waqt dhuaan tha."

128
00:06:47,435 --> 00:06:48,819
Dhuaan — yeh lafz kyun?

129
00:06:49,173 --> 00:06:51,848
Shuru ki kainat mein na pathar tha, na paani, na loha.

130
00:06:51,867 --> 00:06:57,407
Sirf do halki gasein: taqreeban 75 feesad hydrogen, 25 feesad helium.

131
00:06:57,622 --> 00:07:01,497
Itni garam aur ghani — ke roshni bhi us mein se seedhi guzar nahi sakti thi.

132
00:07:01,517 --> 00:07:04,247
Ek garam, dhundla, gas ka samandar.

133
00:07:04,557 --> 00:07:06,893
Aur usi ayat ka agla hissa, jis ka tarjuma hai:

134
00:07:06,913 --> 00:07:09,242
"Aur Hum ne har zinda cheez paani se banayi."

135
00:07:09,517 --> 00:07:11,893
Ek hi ayat. Pehle hisse mein kainat ki paidaish.

136
00:07:11,913 --> 00:07:13,542
Doosre mein zindagi ki bunyaad.

137
00:07:13,848 --> 00:07:17,632
Aaj NASA jab doosre sayyaron par zindagi dhoondta hai — to uska usool kya hai?

138
00:07:18,124 --> 00:07:20,218
"Follow the water." Paani ka peecha karo.

139
00:07:20,281 --> 00:07:24,887
Kyunke aaj tak ek bhi aisa jaandaar nahi mila jo paani ke baghair jee sake.

140
00:07:25,920 --> 00:07:27,535
Ab yahan ek samajhdar aadmi kahega:

141
00:07:27,555 --> 00:07:31,284
"Theek hai, kainat ki shuruaat hui. Lekin is se Khuda kaise sabit hua?

142
00:07:31,920 --> 00:07:33,810
Ho sakta hai yeh sab khud ba khud ho gaya ho."

143
00:07:34,014 --> 00:07:36,810
Bohat acha sawal hai. Aur kamaal yeh hai ke yeh sawal...

144
00:07:36,829 --> 00:07:39,560
Quran ne khud uthaya hai. Sirf do ayaton mein.

145
00:07:39,865 --> 00:07:42,829
Ab woh waqia — jiska wada maine shuru mein kiya tha.

146
00:07:43,410 --> 00:07:44,925
Jang-e-Badr ke baad ka zamana hai.

147
00:07:44,944 --> 00:07:48,074
Quraysh ke sardar Mut'im bin Adi ka beta — Jubayr — Madinah aaya hai.

148
00:07:48,574 --> 00:07:50,979
Apne qaidiyon ko chhudwane. Woh abhi Musalman nahi.

149
00:07:51,360 --> 00:07:52,254
Maghrib ka waqt hai.

150
00:07:52,274 --> 00:07:56,284
Aap sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wasallam Surah Tur ki tilawat farma rahe hain.

151
00:07:56,622 --> 00:07:57,463
Jubayr sun raha hai.

152
00:07:57,483 --> 00:08:01,092
Aur phir yeh ayat aati hai, Surah Tur ki, jis ka tarjuma hai:

153
00:08:01,528 --> 00:08:03,792
"Kya yeh kisi cheez ke baghair hi paida ho gaye?

154
00:08:04,023 --> 00:08:06,008
Ya yeh khud apne khaliq hain?

155
00:08:06,028 --> 00:08:08,137
Ya inhone aasmanon aur zameen ko paida kiya hai?

156
00:08:08,497 --> 00:08:11,082
Nahi — balke yeh yaqeen hi nahi rakhte."

157
00:08:11,372 --> 00:08:13,668
Jubayr kehte hain — aur yeh Sahih Bukhari ki riwayat hai:

158
00:08:13,687 --> 00:08:15,677
"Kaada qalbi an yatir." — "Qareeb tha ke mera dil ud jaye."

159
00:08:16,088 --> 00:08:17,852
Kyun? In do ayaton mein aisa kya hai?

160
00:08:18,267 --> 00:08:21,052
Dhyan se suniye — yeh is video ka sab se aham hissa hai.

161
00:08:21,432 --> 00:08:26,073
Jo cheez pehle nahi thi — aur phir wujood mein aa gayi — uske sirf chaar hi raaste ho sakte hain.

162
00:08:26,093 --> 00:08:27,082
Paanchwan koi nahi.

163
00:08:27,218 --> 00:08:28,372
Pehla raasta:

164
00:08:28,392 --> 00:08:31,777
woh "kuch nahi" se — bina kisi sabab ke — khud ba khud aa gayi.

165
00:08:31,980 --> 00:08:34,081
Aap raat ko kamra band kar ke soye.

166
00:08:34,100 --> 00:08:36,581
Subah utthe — to kamre ke beech mein ek haathi khada hai.

167
00:08:36,600 --> 00:08:39,701
Aap poochte hain: yeh kahan se aaya? Jawab milta hai: "Kahin se nahi.

168
00:08:39,721 --> 00:08:40,550
Bas aa gaya."

169
00:08:40,885 --> 00:08:41,740
Aap maan lenge?

170
00:08:41,760 --> 00:08:44,670
"Kuch nahi" ke paas na taqat hai, na qanoon, na imkaan.

171
00:08:44,783 --> 00:08:47,668
Zero jama zero jama zero... zero hi rehta hai.

172
00:08:48,033 --> 00:08:54,958
Aur jab koi scientist kehta hai "kainat nothing se bani" — to uska "nothing" asal mein energy, fields aur physics ke qawaneen se bhara hota hai.

173
00:08:55,606 --> 00:08:56,656
Woh "kuch nahi" nahi hai.

174
00:08:57,091 --> 00:08:59,236
Sawal wahin khada hai: woh qawaneen kahan se aaye?

175
00:08:59,736 --> 00:09:01,951
Doosra raasta: usne khud ko khud bana liya.

176
00:09:01,971 --> 00:09:04,042
Yaani banne se pehle hi maujood tha.

177
00:09:04,451 --> 00:09:05,632
Yeh aisa hai jaise koi kahe:

178
00:09:05,652 --> 00:09:08,896
"Meri ammi ne khud apne aap ko janam diya." Namumkin.

179
00:09:09,211 --> 00:09:11,907
Teesra raasta: usay kisi aur bani hui cheez ne banaya.

180
00:09:11,927 --> 00:09:14,167
Aur usay kisi aur ne. Aur usay kisi aur ne...

181
00:09:14,187 --> 00:09:16,356
kabhi na khatam hone wala silsila.

182
00:09:16,611 --> 00:09:17,776
Ek misaal suniye.

183
00:09:18,072 --> 00:09:20,586
Mujhe 100 rupay chahiyen. Main aap se maangta hoon. Aap kehte hain:

184
00:09:20,606 --> 00:09:24,211
"Mere paas nahi — apne dost se le kar deta hoon." Dost kehta hai:

185
00:09:24,231 --> 00:09:27,731
"Mere paas bhi nahi — main apne dost se leta hoon." Aur woh apne dost se.

186
00:09:27,751 --> 00:09:28,922
Aur woh apne dost se...

187
00:09:29,267 --> 00:09:35,932
Agar yeh silsila kabhi khatam hi na ho — agar kisi ke paas bhi apna paisa na ho — to kya mere haath mein kabhi 100 ka note aayega?

188
00:09:35,951 --> 00:09:36,661
Kabhi nahi.

189
00:09:36,820 --> 00:09:40,704
Lekin note mere haath mein hai. Kainat maujood hai. Aap maujood hain.

190
00:09:41,120 --> 00:09:44,245
Iska matlab: is silsile ke peeche koi ek aisa zaroor hai

191
00:09:44,789 --> 00:09:46,334
Jiska wujood uska apna hai.

192
00:09:46,384 --> 00:09:49,274
Jo kisi ka mohtaj nahi — aur sab jiske mohtaj hain.

193
00:09:50,113 --> 00:09:52,543
Yehi chautha raasta hai. Aur yehi akela raasta bachta hai.

194
00:09:52,893 --> 00:09:57,177
Ibn Sina ne isay kaha "Wajib-ul-Wujood." Aur Quran ne sirf do lafzon mein keh diya:

195
00:09:57,613 --> 00:10:00,957
Surah Al-Ikhlas ki ayat hai, jis ka tarjuma: "Allah be-niyaz hai."

196
00:10:01,432 --> 00:10:03,857
Ab samjhe — Jubayr ka dil kyun udne laga tha?

197
00:10:03,895 --> 00:10:06,800
Do ayaton ne har raasta band kar diya tha.

198
00:10:06,839 --> 00:10:10,543
Aur aaj West ki universities mein isi daleel ka naam kya hai?

199
00:10:10,938 --> 00:10:14,533
"Kalam Cosmological Argument." "Kalam" — yeh lafz Arabi ka hai.

200
00:10:14,552 --> 00:10:16,543
Musalman mutakallimeen se liya gaya.

201
00:10:17,758 --> 00:10:19,418
Aur science aaj kahan khadi hai?

202
00:10:19,437 --> 00:10:24,337
2003 mein teen cosmologists — Borde, Guth aur Vilenkin — ne ek theorem sabit kiya:

203
00:10:24,357 --> 00:10:27,788
jo kainat ausatan phailti rahi ho — woh maazi mein hamesha se nahi ho sakti.

204
00:10:27,957 --> 00:10:29,607
Uske maazi ki ek had hai.

205
00:10:30,057 --> 00:10:30,913
Vilenkin ne likha:

206
00:10:30,932 --> 00:10:34,552
"Cosmologists ab ek hamesha-se-maujood kainat ke peeche nahi chhup sakte.

207
00:10:34,572 --> 00:10:36,562
Bhaagne ka koi raasta nahi."

208
00:10:36,893 --> 00:10:38,128
Aur Stephen Hawking ne likha:

209
00:10:38,148 --> 00:10:42,597
"Taqreeban har koi ab yeh maanta hai ke kainat — aur khud waqt — ki ibtida Big Bang se hui."

210
00:10:43,077 --> 00:10:46,533
Haan — us ibtida se "pehle" kya tha, is par physics mein behas jaari hai.

211
00:10:46,552 --> 00:10:51,143
Lekin "kainat hamesha se aisi hi thi" — woh purana qila gir chuka hai.

212
00:10:51,503 --> 00:10:57,712
Aur NASA ke astronomer Robert Jastrow — jo khud ko agnostic kehte the — unhone jo likha, woh sunne se ta'alluq rakhta hai:

213
00:10:57,986 --> 00:10:59,883
"Scientist jahalat ke pahaad chadhta gaya.

214
00:10:59,903 --> 00:11:02,413
Sab se oonchi choti sar karne hi wala tha.

215
00:11:02,471 --> 00:11:09,186
Aur jab woh aakhri chattan par chadh kar upar aaya — to wahan mazhabi aalimon ka ek giroh us ka istiqbal kar raha tha...

216
00:11:09,206 --> 00:11:11,014
jo sadiyon se wahin baitha tha."

217
00:11:11,975 --> 00:11:15,620
Aur jis kitab ne ibtida batayi — usne anjaam bhi bataya hai:

218
00:11:15,946 --> 00:11:18,191
Surah Al-Anbiya mein aata hai, jis ka tarjuma hai:

219
00:11:18,701 --> 00:11:23,475
"Jis din Hum aasman ko yun lapet denge jaise likhe hue kaghzaat ka tumaar lapet diya jata hai.

220
00:11:23,495 --> 00:11:27,765
Jaise Hum ne pehli takhleeq ki ibtida ki thi — waise hi usay lautayenge."

221
00:11:27,990 --> 00:11:30,941
Jo khola gaya tha — woh lapet diya jayega.

222
00:11:31,264 --> 00:11:35,708
Science abhi nahi jaanti ke kainat ka anjaam kya hoga — is liye hum yahan koi daawa nahi karte.

223
00:11:35,923 --> 00:11:38,908
Sirf itna: jis kitab ki ibtida wali baat sach nikli...

224
00:11:39,139 --> 00:11:42,974
uski anjaam wali baat ko halka mat lijiye. To aaj humne kya dekha?

225
00:11:42,994 --> 00:11:44,583
Einstein ne kaha: kainat ruki hui hai.

226
00:11:45,293 --> 00:11:47,418
Quran ne kaha: "Hum wus'at dene wale hain."

227
00:11:47,578 --> 00:11:50,194
Falsafe ne kaha: kainat hamesha se hai. Quran ne kaha:

228
00:11:50,214 --> 00:11:52,483
"Yeh judi hui thi — Hum ne isay khola."

229
00:11:52,817 --> 00:11:53,951
Aur jab insaan ne kaha:

230
00:11:53,971 --> 00:11:56,093
"Yeh sab khud ba khud ho gaya" — to Quran ne poocha:

231
00:11:56,113 --> 00:12:00,072
"Kya yeh kisi cheez ke baghair paida ho gaye — ya yeh khud khaliq hain?"

232
00:12:00,533 --> 00:12:03,028
Quran physics ki kitab nahi. Yeh hidayat ki kitab hai.

233
00:12:03,048 --> 00:12:04,717
Lekin isne ek wada kiya tha:

234
00:12:05,013 --> 00:12:06,968
Surah Fussilat mein aata hai, jis ka tarjuma:

235
00:12:06,988 --> 00:12:15,293
"Hum unhein apni nishaniyan dikhayenge — aafaaq mein bhi, aur khud unki apni jaanon mein bhi — yahan tak ke un par khul jayega ke yehi haq hai."

236
00:12:16,038 --> 00:12:18,858
Aafaaq mein — door aasmanon mein — aaj humne dekh liya.

237
00:12:18,878 --> 00:12:21,447
Lekin "khud unki jaanon mein"? Aapke apne andar?

238
00:12:21,768 --> 00:12:25,442
Agli video mein hum kainat ki sab se chhoti duniya mein utrenge — atom ke andar.

239
00:12:25,462 --> 00:12:28,033
Jahan ek cheez ek hi waqt mein do jagah hoti hai.

240
00:12:28,253 --> 00:12:33,217
Aur wahan aapko Imam Ghazali ka woh jumla milega — jis par duniya 900 saal hansti rahi:

241
00:12:33,368 --> 00:12:35,212
"Aag kapde ko nahi jalati."

